cordis-api:jobs:abstract onJobsChanged(l.en:
/** Register an effect-scoped observer of visible-set changes. It fires after every commit that changes what list returns for that owner — registration, every stopping transition (including the one teardown performs before it awaits a slow producer), settlement, owner-disposal removal, and the emptying that service disposal commits — so an observer re-reads rather than accumulating deltas.

Delivery is owner-relative on the same terms as onJobDone: an observer registered from an unscoped context — a host composition's own carrier — sees every owner, while one registered under an agent composition's scope sees exactly the agents composed under it.

This is not a superset of onJobDone: that one delivers the terminal record under first-wins semantics a job controller couples to notice delivery, while this one carries no delivery meaning and marks nothing reported. Listeners are contained and never awaited.

cordis-api:jobs:abstract onJobsChanged(l.zh:
/** 注册可见集合变化的作用域化观察者。它在每次提交改变了该所有者对应的 list 返回值后触发——注册、每次停止转换（包括拆卸在等待慢速生产者之前执行的那次）、结算、所有者销毁移除，以及服务销毁提交的清空——因此观察者会重新读取而不是累积增量。

投递与 onJobDone 相同，是所有者相对的：从无作用域上下文（宿主组合自身的载体）注册的观察者能看到每个所有者，而在代理组合的作用域下注册的观察者恰好看到组合在其中的那些代理。

这不是 onJobDone 的超集：后者在后台任务控制器与通知投递耦合的先到先得语义下投递终结记录，而前者不承载任何投递含义，也不将任何内容标记为已报告。监听器是受控的且绝不会被等待。
